---
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-subtle via-white to-white pt-8 pb-14 lg:pt-14 lg:pb-20 border-b border-surface-border">
  <!-- Subtle decorative ambient lights -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[300px] bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-100/40 via-brand-50/20 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Top Live Status & Telemetry Pill -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-brand-200 text-xs text-brand-700 font-semibold mb-6 shadow-2xs hover:border-brand-400 transition-all">
        <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-emerald-800">7×24h 探针在线</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
        <span class="text-ink-heading font-medium">晚高峰 20:00~23:00 真实压测</span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
        <span class="text-brand-700 font-bold font-mono">2026年11月独家更新</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline (Authentic & direct human voice, piercing real pain points) -->
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[50px] font-black tracking-tight text-ink-heading leading-tight sm:leading-tight">
        拒绝晚高峰卡成 PPT 与跑路野鸡云<br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-brand-800 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          2026 稳定好用的专线机场自费实测榜
        </span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Grounded, veteran blogger subtitle with strong resonance -->
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-ink-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto font-normal">
        白天测速千兆飞起，<strong>一到晚上 8 点连 1080P 都转圈？刚充年付没两月，老板直接删库跑路？</strong><br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        社长只做一件事：<strong>自费实测晚高峰 8 点真实表现</strong>，剔除虚标公网慢车，只挑 <strong class="text-brand-700 underline decoration-brand-200 underline-offset-4">不过墙的真 IPLC/IEPL 物理专线</strong>。看 4K/8K 视频秒拖进度条、ChatGPT/Claude 顺畅不封号，帮你闭眼选到省心好梯子。
      </p>

      <!-- Quick Action CTA Group -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
        <a
          href="#top-podium"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-md hover:shadow-lg active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>🏆 直接看 Top 3 闭眼入金榜</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/compare"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 text-ink-heading font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-all flex items-center gap-2 shadow-2xs"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
          </svg>
          <span>📊 11 家专线核心参数横评</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#calculator"
          class="px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-subtle hover:bg-brand-50 border border-surface-border text-brand-700 font-bold text-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5"
        >
          <span>🧮 流量预算精算器</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Scenario Tags (按需秒选) -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 flex-wrap text-xs text-ink-muted">
        <span class="font-medium text-ink-heading">⚡ 快速对号入座：</span>
        <a href="/recommend" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle hover:bg-brand-50 text-ink-body hover:text-brand-600 border border-surface-border transition-colors">
          🎬 4K/8K 追剧秒开
        </a>
        <a href="/ai" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle hover:bg-brand-50 text-ink-body hover:text-brand-600 border border-surface-border transition-colors">
          🤖 ChatGPT / Claude 住宅免封
        </a>
        <a href="/cheap" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle hover:bg-brand-50 text-ink-body hover:text-brand-600 border border-surface-border transition-colors">
          💰 ¥4.8~¥8 平价学生包
        </a>
        <a href="/clients" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle hover:bg-brand-50 text-ink-body hover:text-brand-600 border border-surface-border transition-colors">
          📱 客户端导入教程
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Hard Core Benchmarks / Live Data Badges -->
      <div class="mt-10 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-surface-border shadow-sm grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center">
        <div class="space-y-0.5 border-r border-surface-border last:border-none">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-ink-heading font-mono">
            980 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-ink-muted">Mbps</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-ink-body font-medium">晚高峰实测下行</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-emerald-700 font-mono">4K/8K 满速拖拽</div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-0.5 border-r border-surface-border last:border-none">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600 font-mono">
            &lt; 0.02%
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-ink-body font-medium">专线物理平均丢包</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted font-mono">公网常达 20%+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-0.5 border-r border-surface-border last:border-none">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-brand-600 font-mono">
            0 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-ink-muted">分风控</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-ink-body font-medium">原生家庭住宅 IP</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-brand-700 font-mono">Scamalytics 纯净</div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-0.5">
          <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-amber-600 font-mono">
            ¥4.8 <span class="text-xs font-normal text-ink-muted">/月起</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-ink-body font-medium">平价门槛坚持月付</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-800 font-mono">拒绝大额年付坑</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Real Review Trust Signals & Features (Rich, substantive, non-generic) -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-left">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-card transition-all space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-brand-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
              ⚡
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 text-brand-700 font-bold border border-blue-200">
              点对点内网
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-heading">
            真物理专线不过墙
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-body leading-relaxed">
            深港/沪日物理海底光缆内网直连，完全不走 GFW 防火墙检测，敏感时期与晚高峰 0 断流。
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-surface-border text-[11px] text-ink-muted flex items-center justify-between font-mono">
            <span>物理延迟: 28ms</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">AAA+级</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-emerald-300 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-card transition-all space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
              🤖
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 font-bold border border-emerald-200">
              家庭住宅宽带
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-heading">
            原生住宅纯净 IP
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-body leading-relaxed">
            由美国 AT&T、英国 BT 等真实家庭宽带直接分配，100% 杜绝 Cloudflare 1020 拦截与封号。
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-surface-border text-[11px] text-ink-muted flex items-center justify-between font-mono">
            <span>ChatGPT / Claude</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">全绿免验证</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-sky-300 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-card transition-all space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-50 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
              🚀
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 font-bold border border-sky-200">
              千兆网络压测
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-heading">
            真实晚高峰探针测速
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-body leading-relaxed">
            每晚 20:00~23:00 真实家用宽带压测，公开下行速率与抖动曲线，拒绝修图作假的跑路盘。
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-surface-border text-[11px] text-ink-muted flex items-center justify-between font-mono">
            <span>YouTube 8K</span>
            <span class="text-sky-700 font-bold">45万+码率</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-amber-300 shadow-2xs hover:shadow-card transition-all space-y-2">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
              🛡️
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 font-bold border border-amber-200">
              社长避坑准则
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink-heading">
            独家 88 折与坚持月付
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-body leading-relaxed">
            争取官方专属大额抵扣码。强烈建议新手首月按月付费（几元至十几元），满意再考虑升级。
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 border-t border-surface-border text-[11px] text-ink-muted flex items-center justify-between font-mono">
            <span>官方专属立减</span>
            <span class="text-amber-800 font-bold">折上折保障</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 30 秒懒人决策速查条 -->
      <div class="mt-8 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50/70 via-white to-emerald-50/70 border border-brand-200 text-left shadow-2xs">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-surface-border">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-brand-600 text-white font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">🎯</span>
            <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-ink-heading">社长 30 秒选型决策指引（对号入座）：</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted font-mono">11 月晚高峰实测建议</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 pt-3 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-ink-body">🥇 追求综合首推、晚高峰 8K 满跑</span>
            <a href="/airports/shandianshu" class="font-bold text-brand-600 hover:underline shrink-0">闪电鼠 (¥8) ➔</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-ink-body">🥈 追求老牌 6 年口碑、住宅 IP 解锁</span>
            <a href="/airports/dalaoyun" class="font-bold text-brand-600 hover:underline shrink-0">大佬云 (¥8) ➔</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-ink-body">🥉 追求大流量影音、高性价比专线</span>
            <a href="/airports/liulianyun" class="font-bold text-brand-600 hover:underline shrink-0">榴莲云 (¥8) ➔</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-ink-body">🎮 追求外服电竞超低延迟、NAT 1</span>
            <a href="/airports/shenxing" class="font-bold text-brand-600 hover:underline shrink-0">神行加速 (¥15) ➔</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-ink-body">💰 学生党平价极速尝鲜、月付首选</span>
            <a href="/airports/guangnianti" class="font-bold text-brand-600 hover:underline shrink-0">光年梯 (¥7) ➔</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-300 transition-colors">
            <span class="text-ink-body">📦 超大流量需求、多设备合租</span>
            <a href="/airports/huanqiuti" class="font-bold text-brand-600 hover:underline shrink-0">环球梯 (¥8) ➔</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
